OL,3,GNEWSATeen's level crossing star jumps  
OL,4,Aspark safety warning                   
OL,6,FVideo of a teenage girl doing star     
OL,7,Fjumps on a level crossing near Leeds   
OL,8,Fhas sparked a warning to young people  
OL,9,Fnot to risk their lives on the         
OL,10,Frailways.                              
OL,12,FThe incident, which was caught on CCTV 
OL,13,Fon the line at Methley North in        
OL,14,FSeptember, also shows two teenage boys 
OL,15,Fdawdling with the girl on the crossing,
OL,16,Fwith one taking a photograph.          
OL,18,FAs a result of the incident, Network   
OL,19,FRail said its staff had contacted      
OL,20,Fschools in the area to remind pupils of
OL,21,Fthe dangers of playing on the railway  
OL,22,Fand at level crossings.                
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
