OL,3,GNEWSATeen's level crossing star jumps  
OL,4,Aspark safety warning                   
OL,6,FThere were 462 safety incidents at     
OL,7,Flevel crossings across the country in  
OL,8,F2025-26, up by more than a fifth from  
OL,9,Feight years previously, a Network Rail 
OL,10,Fspokesperson said.                     
